  "title": "The Non-Stop Spin",
  "summary": "Can energy work in ways we never expected? Join us in an exciting interactive experience where we discover how a unique form of energy can create motion and rotation in surprising ways. We build, test and observe how energy transforms into movement right before our eyes. This experience invites you to think differently and look around you with greater curiosity to discover unfamiliar energy sources that may be closer than we imagine. Get ready to explore, experiment and see motion from a whole new perspective!",
